---
import Home from "../layouts/home.astro";
import Socials from "../components/Socials.astro";
---

<Home>
	<section class="about-section">
		<div class="intro-section">
			<p>hey, i'm shivang.</p>
			<p>
				i'm a cs undergrad trying to get better at
				backend and low-level programming. basically,
				figuring out how things work under the hood
				while still building stuff people can actually
				use.
			</p>
			<p>i mainly work with:</p>
		</div>

		<div class="tech-stack-section">
			<span class="stack-button">[c]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[python]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[lua]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[node.js]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[sqlite]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[neovim]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[docker]</span>
			<span class="stack-button">[arch linux]</span>
		</div>

		<div class="intro-section">
			<p>
				lately i've been spending more time
				understanding systems, memory, performance,
				tooling.
			</p>
			<p>
				i also write <a class="blog-link" href="/notes"
					>technical blogs</a
				> whenever i build something or stumble onto something
				worth sharing.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-section">
			<p>
				if you want to collaborate, discuss ideas, or
				just point out something i got wrong, feel free
				to reach out:
				<a
					class="email-link"
					href="mailto:hey@seivarya.in"
					>hey@seivarya.in</a
				>
			</p>
			<p>
				outside of programming, i'm probably playing
				games, reading random blogs/books, or watching
				something. i have a bunch of social links around
				here somewhere, but i'm not active on most of
				them if you want a quick reply, <a
					class="discord-link"
					href="https://discord.com/users/1345276369566699530"
					>discord</a
				> is your best bet.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<Socials />
</Home>

<style>
	.contact-section {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.contact-section {
			margin-bottom: 15px;
		}
		.tech-stack-section {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}
	a {
		color: unset;
	}
	.contact-section a,
	.contact-section a:visited,
	.contact-section a:active {
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
		padding-bottom: 1px;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition:
			border-bottom-color 0.25s ease,
			opacity 0.25s ease;
	}

	.contact-section .friend-link {
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		border-bottom: none;
	}
	.contact-section .email-link {
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
	}
	.contact-section .discord-link {
		color: var(--color-brand-discord);
		border-bottom-color: rgba(157, 166, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.contact-section a:hover,
	.contact-section a:focus {
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.contact-section .email-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
	}
	.contact-section .discord-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--color-brand-discord);
	}
	.about-section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.tech-stack-section {
		display: flex;
		color: var(--color-text-main);
		margin-top: 35px;
		margin-bottom: 35px;
		text-align: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		font-size: 16px;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.intro-section {
		margin-top: 20px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: 0px;
	}
	.intro-section p,
	.contact-section p {
		margin: 0 0 15px 0;
	}
	.contact-section p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
</style>
